      "source": "2024新高考I卷",
      "body": "已知向量 $\\vec{a}=(0,1)$，$\\vec{b}=(2,x)$，若 $\\vec{b} \\perp (\\vec{b}-4\\vec{a})$，则 $x=$（　）",
      "options": [
        "$-2$",
        "$-1$",
        "$1$",
        "$2$"
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "analysis": "$\\vec{b}-4\\vec{a}=(2,x-4)$，由 $\\vec{b} \\perp (\\vec{b}-4\\vec{a})$ 得 $\\vec{b} \\cdot (\\vec{b}-4\\vec{a})=0$，即 $4+x(x-4)=0$，解得 $x=2$。",
      "useCount": 0,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-17 14:16:26",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-17 14:16:26"
    },
    {
